# DS-8 probe, rack socket 1: does a socket chip have sp and ra?
# r10: ra after the jal (5, the line after it). r11: sp after one
# push (1). r12: 1 once it got back from test. IncorrectVariable at the
# move sp line means no sp.
move r12 0
jal test
move r12 1
done:
yield
j done
test:
move r12 ra
move sp 0
push 5
move r11 sp
move r7 ra
j ra
# test
